","serverPath":"https://assets.atdw-online.com.au/images/e9c5fc79e6ab4aed223719fd57d8f6b9.jpeg?rect=0%2C398%2C7632%2C4293&w=1600&h=900&rot=360&q=eyJ0eXBlIjoibGlzdGluZyIsImxpc3RpbmdJZCI6IjZhNGVmMGFmNDA3MDgwZDY1MzEwNTRkYSIsImRpc3RyaWJ1dG9ySWQiOiI1NmIxZWI5MzQ0ZmVjYTNkZjJlMzIwY2IiLCJhcGlrZXlJZCI6IjU2YjFlZmVlMGNmMjEzYWQyMGRkMjE3MCJ9","attributeIdMultimediaContent":"IMAGE","attributeIdMultimediaContentDescription":"Image","attributeIdSizeOrientation":"16X9","width":"1600","height":"900","altText":"Patient consultation","caption":"Patients can be hesitant to ask questions","photographer":"Fat Camera","copyright":"iStock","sequenceNumber":"300"},{"marketVariantId":"","multimediaId":"6a4f05bd07029ce0531bdf87","authoredDate":"2026-07-09","serverPath":"https://assets.atdw-online.com.au/images/e9c5fc79e6ab4aed223719fd57d8f6b9.jpeg?rect=0%2C398%2C7632%2C4293&w=800&h=450&rot=360&q=eyJ0eXBlIjoibGlzdGluZyIsImxpc3RpbmdJZCI6IjZhNGVmMGFmNDA3MDgwZDY1MzEwNTRkYSIsImRpc3RyaWJ1dG9ySWQiOiI1NmIxZWI5MzQ0ZmVjYTNkZjJlMzIwY2IiLCJhcGlrZXlJZCI6IjU2YjFlZmVlMGNmMjEzYWQyMGRkMjE3MCJ9","attributeIdMultimediaContent":"IMAGE","attributeIdMultimediaContentDescription":"Image","attributeIdSizeOrientation":"16X9","width":"800","height":"450","altText":"Patient consultation","caption":"Patients can be hesitant to ask questions","photographer":"Fat Camera","copyright":"iStock","sequenceNumber":"300"},{"marketVariantId":"","multimediaId":"6a4f05bd07029ce0531bdf87","authoredDate":"2026-07-09","serverPath":"https://assets.atdw-online.com.au/images/e9c5fc79e6ab4aed223719fd57d8f6b9.jpeg?rect=0%2C398%2C7632%2C4293&w=280&h=158&rot=360&q=eyJ0eXBlIjoibGlzdGluZyIsImxpc3RpbmdJZCI6IjZhNGVmMGFmNDA3MDgwZDY1MzEwNTRkYSIsImRpc3RyaWJ1dG9ySWQiOiI1NmIxZWI5MzQ0ZmVjYTNkZjJlMzIwY2IiLCJhcGlrZXlJZCI6IjU2YjFlZmVlMGNmMjEzYWQyMGRkMjE3MCJ9","attributeIdMultimediaContent":"IMAGE","attributeIdMultimediaContentDescription":"Image","attributeIdSizeOrientation":"16X9","width":"280","height":"158","altText":"Patient consultation","caption":"Patients can be hesitant to ask questions","photographer":"Fat Camera","copyright":"iStock","sequenceNumber":"300"}],"openTimes":[],"productComments":[{"marketVariantId":"English / Global","attributeIdProductComment":"PRODTRANS ","attributeIdProductCommentDescription":"Product Description Translation","sequenceNumber":"","attributeIdLanguageWritten":"ENGLISH","attributeIdLanguageWrittenDescription":"English","commentText":"Breast cancer can raise questions that many people hesitate to ask their medical team.\n\nThat's why Breast Cancer Trials is bringing together a panel of leading experts alongside women with lived experience of breast cancer to explore how breast cancer intersects with sexual health and intimacy, reproductive choices and identity, while highlighting the critical role of research in improving patient outcomes and quality of life.\n\nThe Q&A, moderated by Author and Journalist Annabel Crabb, will create a safe and informative space to unpack the questions many people have, but don't always feel comfortable asking.\n\nWhether you're personally affected by breast cancer, supporting someone who is, working in healthcare, or simply want to better understand these important issues, this Q&A offers expert insight, real experiences and meaningful conversation. \n\nThis public event will be hosted at the QLD State Library in Brisbane, and also hosted live online."},{"marketVariantId":"Japanese","attributeIdProductComment":"PRODTRANS ","attributeIdProductCommentDescription":"Product Description Translation","sequenceNumber":"100","attributeIdLanguageWritten":"JAPANESE","attributeIdLanguageWrittenDescription":"Japanese","commentText":"乳がんは、多くの人が医療チームに尋ねるのをためらうような疑問を抱かせることがあります。\n\nそこで、Breast Cancer Trialsは、乳がんを経験した女性たちと、一流の専門家によるパネルディスカッションを開催します。乳がんが性的な健康と親密さ、生殖に関する選択、そしてアイデンティティとどのように交わるのかを探り、患者の予後と生活の質の向上における研究の重要な役割を強調します。\n\n作家でありジャーナリストでもあるアナベル・クラブ氏が司会を務めるこの質疑応答セッションは、多くの人が抱えているものの、なかなか口に出せない疑問を、安心して、そして有益な形で掘り下げて話し合う場となるでしょう。\n\n乳がんを患っている方、乳がん患者を支えている方、医療従事者の方、あるいは単にこれらの重要な問題についてより深く理解したい方など、どなたにとっても、この質疑応答セッションは専門家の洞察、実体験、そして有意義な対話の機会となるでしょう。\n\nこの公開イベントは、ブリスベンのクイーンズランド州立図書館で開催されるほか、オンラインでもライブ配信されます。"},{"marketVariantId":"Portuguese","attributeIdProductComment":"PRODTRANS ","attributeIdProductCommentDescription":"Product Description Translation","sequenceNumber":"100","attributeIdLanguageWritten":"PORT-EUR","attributeIdLanguageWrittenDescription":"Portuguese","commentText":"O câncer de mama pode suscitar dúvidas que muitas pessoas hesitam em abordar com sua equipe médica.\n\nPor isso, a Breast Cancer Trials reúne um painel de especialistas renomados e mulheres com experiência própria com o câncer de mama para explorar a relação entre a doença e a saúde sexual e a intimidade, as escolhas reprodutivas e a identidade, destacando o papel crucial da pesquisa na melhoria dos resultados e da qualidade de vida das pacientes.\n\nA sessão de perguntas e respostas, moderada pela escritora e jornalista Annabel Crabb, criará um espaço seguro e informativo para esclarecer as dúvidas que muitas pessoas têm, mas que nem sempre se sentem à vontade para expressar.\n\nSe você foi afetada pelo câncer de mama, apoia alguém que foi, trabalha na área da saúde ou simplesmente deseja compreender melhor essas questões importantes, esta sessão de perguntas e respostas oferece conhecimento especializado, experiências reais e uma conversa significativa.\n\nEste evento aberto ao público será realizado na Biblioteca Estadual de Queensland, em Brisbane, e também transmitido ao vivo online."},{"marketVariantId":"Indonesian","attributeIdProductComment":"PRODTRANS ","attributeIdProductCommentDescription":"Product Description Translation","sequenceNumber":"100","attributeIdLanguageWritten":"INDONESIAN","attributeIdLanguageWrittenDescription":"Indonesian","commentText":"Kanker payudara dapat menimbulkan pertanyaan yang seringkali membuat banyak orang ragu untuk bertanya kepada tim medis mereka.\n\nOleh karena itu, Breast Cancer Trials menghadirkan panel ahli terkemuka bersama perempuan yang memiliki pengalaman langsung dengan kanker payudara untuk mengeksplorasi bagaimana kanker payudara beririsan dengan kesehatan seksual dan keintiman, pilihan reproduksi dan identitas, sambil menyoroti peran penting penelitian dalam meningkatkan hasil dan kualitas hidup pasien.\n\nSesi tanya jawab, yang dimoderatori oleh Penulis dan Jurnalis Annabel Crabb, akan menciptakan ruang yang aman dan informatif untuk membahas pertanyaan-pertanyaan yang dimiliki banyak orang, tetapi tidak selalu merasa nyaman untuk bertanya.\n\nBaik Anda secara pribadi terkena kanker payudara, mendukung seseorang yang mengalaminya, bekerja di bidang kesehatan, atau hanya ingin lebih memahami isu-isu penting ini, sesi tanya jawab ini menawarkan wawasan ahli, pengalaman nyata, dan percakapan yang bermakna.\n\nAcara publik ini akan diselenggarakan di Perpustakaan Negara Bagian Queensland di Brisbane, dan juga disiarkan langsung secara daring."},{"marketVariantId":"French","attributeIdProductComment":"PRODTRANS ","attributeIdProductCommentDescription":"Product Description Translation","sequenceNumber":"100","attributeIdLanguageWritten":"FRENCH","attributeIdLanguageWrittenDescription":"French","commentText":"Le cancer du sein soulève souvent des questions que beaucoup hésitent à poser à leur équipe médicale.\n\nC’est pourquoi Breast Cancer Trials réunit un panel d’experts de renom et des femmes ayant vécu un cancer du sein afin d’explorer les liens entre le cancer du sein et la santé sexuelle et l’intimité, les choix en matière de reproduction et l’identité, tout en soulignant le rôle crucial de la recherche pour améliorer la prise en charge des patientes et leur qualité de vie.\n\nAnimée par l’auteure et journaliste Annabel Crabb, la séance de questions-réponses offrira un espace d’échange bienveillant et informatif pour aborder les questions que beaucoup se posent, mais qu’elles n’osent pas toujours formuler.\n\nQue vous soyez personnellement touchée par le cancer du sein, que vous souteniez une personne malade, que vous travailliez dans le secteur de la santé ou que vous souhaitiez simplement mieux comprendre ces enjeux importants, cette séance de questions-réponses vous apportera des éclairages d’experts, des témoignages et un dialogue constructif.\n\nCet événement public se tiendra à la Bibliothèque d’État du Queensland à Brisbane et sera également diffusé en direct en ligne."},{"marketVariantId":"Italian","attributeIdProductComment":"PRODTRANS ","attributeIdProductCommentDescription":"Product Description Translation","sequenceNumber":"100","attributeIdLanguageWritten":"ITALIAN","attributeIdLanguageWrittenDescription":"Italian","commentText":"Il tumore al seno può sollevare interrogativi che molte persone esitano a porre al proprio team medico.\n\nPer questo motivo, Breast Cancer Trials riunisce un panel di esperti di spicco insieme a donne che hanno vissuto in prima persona l'esperienza del tumore al seno, per esplorare come questa malattia si intrecci con la salute sessuale e l'intimità, le scelte riproduttive e l'identità, sottolineando al contempo il ruolo cruciale della ricerca nel migliorare gli esiti clinici e la qualità della vita delle pazienti.\n\nLa sessione di domande e risposte, moderata dall'autrice e giornalista Annabel Crabb, creerà uno spazio sicuro e informativo per affrontare i quesiti che molte persone si pongono, ma che non sempre si sentono a proprio agio a formulare.\n\nChe siate personalmente colpiti dal tumore al seno, che stiate supportando qualcuno che lo è, che lavoriate nel settore sanitario o che vogliate semplicemente comprendere meglio queste importanti tematiche, questa sessione di domande e risposte offre approfondimenti di esperti, esperienze reali e un dialogo costruttivo.\n\nQuesto evento pubblico si terrà presso la Biblioteca di Stato del Queensland a Brisbane e sarà trasmesso in diretta anche online."},{"marketVariantId":"German","attributeIdProductComment":"PRODTRANS ","attributeIdProductCommentDescription":"Product Description Translation","sequenceNumber":"100","attributeIdLanguageWritten":"GERMAN","attributeIdLanguageWrittenDescription":"German","commentText":"Brustkrebs wirft Fragen auf, die viele Betroffene nur ungern ihrem Ärzteteam stellen.\n\nDeshalb bringt Breast Cancer Trials ein Expertengremium mit Frauen zusammen, die selbst an Brustkrebs erkrankt sind. Im Mittelpunkt steht die Fragerunde, die von der Autorin und Journalistin Annabel Crabb moderiert wird. Sie bietet einen geschützten und informativen Rahmen, um die Fragen zu klären, die viele Menschen beschäftigen, aber nicht immer offen stellen.\n\nOb Sie selbst von Brustkrebs betroffen sind, jemanden unterstützen, im Gesundheitswesen arbeiten oder sich einfach nur besser über diese wichtigen Themen informieren möchten – diese Fragerunde bietet Ihnen Einblicke von Experten, authentische Erfahrungsberichte und die Möglichkeit zu einem anregenden Austausch.\n\nDie öffentliche Veranstaltung findet in der Queensland State Library in Brisbane statt und wird live online übertragen."},{"marketVariantId":"Spanish","attributeIdProductComment":"PRODTRANS ","attributeIdProductCommentDescription":"Product Description Translation","sequenceNumber":"100","attributeIdLanguageWritten":"SPAN-EUR","attributeIdLanguageWrittenDescription":"Spanish","commentText":"El cáncer de mama puede generar preguntas que muchas personas dudan en formular a su equipo médico.\n\nPor ello, Breast Cancer Trials reúne a un panel de expertos líderes junto con mujeres que han vivido la experiencia del cáncer de mama para explorar cómo esta enfermedad se relaciona con la salud sexual y la intimidad, las decisiones reproductivas y la identidad, al tiempo que destaca el papel fundamental de la investigación para mejorar los resultados y la calidad de vida de las pacientes.\n\nLa sesión de preguntas y respuestas, moderada por la autora y periodista Annabel Crabb, creará un espacio seguro e informativo para abordar las preguntas que muchas personas tienen, pero que no siempre se sienten cómodas formulando.\n\nTanto si te afecta personalmente el cáncer de mama, como si apoyas a alguien que lo padece, trabajas en el sector sanitario o simplemente quieres comprender mejor estos temas importantes, esta sesión de preguntas y respuestas ofrece perspectivas de expertos, experiencias reales y una conversación significativa.\n\nEste evento público se celebrará en la Biblioteca Estatal de Queensland en Brisbane y también se transmitirá en directo en línea."},{"marketVariantId":"Chinese Simplified","attributeIdProductComment":"PRODTRANS ","attributeIdProductCommentDescription":"Product Description Translation","sequenceNumber":"100","attributeIdLanguageWritten":"CHINESE-S","attributeIdLanguageWrittenDescription":"Chinese Simplified","commentText":"乳腺癌可能会引发许多人难以启齿的问题，他们往往羞于向医疗团队咨询。\n\n正因如此，乳腺癌临床试验组织（Breast Cancer Trials）邀请了一批顶尖专家和乳腺癌亲历者，共同探讨乳腺癌与性健康、亲密关系、生育选择和身份认同之间的关联，并着重强调研究在改善患者预后和生活质量方面发挥的关键作用。\n\n本次问答环节由作家兼记者安娜贝尔·克拉布（Annabel Crabb）主持，旨在营造一个安全且信息丰富的空间，帮助大家解答许多人心中的疑问，即使他们有时难以启齿。\n\n无论您是乳腺癌患者本人、正在支持乳腺癌患者、从事医疗保健工作，还是仅仅想更好地了解这些重要议题，本次问答环节都将为您提供专家见解、真实经历和有意义的对话。\n\n本次公众活动将在布里斯班昆士兰州立图书馆举行，并同时进行线上直播。"},{"marketVariantId":"Chinese Traditional","attributeIdProductComment":"PRODTRANS ","attributeIdProductCommentDescription":"Product Description Translation","sequenceNumber":"100","attributeIdLanguageWritten":"CHINESE-T","attributeIdLanguageWrittenDescription":"Chinese Traditional","commentText":"乳癌可能會引發許多人難以啟齒的問題，他們往往羞於向醫療團隊諮詢。\n\n正因如此，乳癌臨床試驗組織（Breast Cancer Trials）邀請了一群頂尖專家和乳癌親歷者，共同探討乳癌與性健康、親密關係、生育選擇和身分認同之間的關聯，並著重強調研究在改善患者預後和生活品質方面發揮的關鍵作用。\n\n本次問答環節由作家兼記者安娜貝爾·克拉布（Annabel Crabb）主持，旨在營造一個安全且資訊豐富的空間，幫助大家解答許多人心中的疑問，即使他們有時難以啟齒。\n\n無論您是乳癌患者本人、正在支持乳癌患者、從事醫療保健工作，還是只是想更好地了解這些重要議題，本次問答環節都將為您提供專家見解、真實經歷和有意義的對話。\n\n本次公眾活動將在布里斯本昆士蘭州立圖書館舉行，並同時進行線上直播。"},{"marketVariantId":"Korean","attributeIdProductComment":"PRODTRANS ","attributeIdProductCommentDescription":"Product Description Translation","sequenceNumber":"100","attributeIdLanguageWritten":"KOREAN","attributeIdLanguageWrittenDescription":"Korean","commentText":"유방암은 많은 사람들이 의료진에게 묻기를 주저하는 질문들을 불러일으킵니다.\n\n이러한 이유로 유방암 임상시험(Breast Cancer Trials)은 유방암 분야의 저명한 전문가들과 유방암 경험 여성들을 초청하여 유방암이 성 건강과 친밀감 생식 선택 및 정체성에 미치는 영향에 대해 논의하고 환자의 치료 결과와 삶의 질 향상에 있어 연구의 중요성을 강조하는 질의응답 시간을 마련했습니다.\n\n작가이자 언론인인 애너벨 크랩(Annabel Crabb)의 진행으로 열리는 이번 질의응답 시간은 많은 사람들이 갖고 있지만 쉽게 묻지 못하는 질문들을 편안하고 유익한 분위기에서 풀어낼 수 있는 자리입니다.\n\n유방암으로 고통받고 있거나 유방암 환자를 돌보고 있거나 의료계에 종사하거나 단순히 이러한 중요한 문제들을 더 잘 이해하고 싶은 분들 모두에게 이번 질의응답 시간은 전문가의 통찰력 실제 경험 그리고 의미 있는 대화를 제공할 것입니다.\n\n이번 공개 행사는 브리즈번에 위치한 퀸즐랜드 주립 도서관에서 개최되며 온라인으로도 생중계됩니다."}],"productSite":[{"siteName":"State Library of QLD","attributeIdSiteType":"VENUE","attributeIdSiteTypeDescription":"Venue","productSiteAddressRelationship":[{"attributeIdAddress":"PHYSICAL","attributeIdAddressDescription":"Physical","addressLine1":"Stanley Place","addressLine2":"","suburbName":"","cityName":"South Brisbane","areaName":"","stateName":"Queensland","countryName":"Australia","addressPostalCode":"4101","overrideDomesticRegionFlag":"0","geocodeGdaLatitude":"-27.4713307","geocodeGdaLongitude":"153.0169509","productSiteAddressStreetDirectoryRelationship":""}],"productSiteAttributeRelationship":"","productSiteCommentRelationship":"","productSiteCommunicationRelationship":"","productSiteLicenceRelationship":"","productSiteRelatedSiteRelationship":"","productSiteMultimediaRelationship":"","productSiteContactRelationship":""}],"mediaLinks":[],"alternateNames":[],"internationalReach":"","rates":[{"ratesType":"","ratesTypeDescription":"","priceFrom":"","priceTo":"","free":"true","rateComment":""}],"deals":[],"jobVacancies":[],"weather":"","menuUrl":"","winelistUrl":"","doesServeMeal":"","openingTime":{"openingTimeType":"","seasonalPeriods":[],"openingTimeComment":"","exceptions":{"exceptionPeriod":"","periods":[]}},"productProximity":[],"productWidget":[],"services":[],"verticalClassifications":[{"productTypeId":"EVTCLASS","productTypeDescription":"Classes, Lessons, Workshops and Talks"}],"pageURL":"/au/en/things-to-do/events/p-6a4ef0af407080d6531054da-breast-cancer-trials-qa","classificationLayer":[{"attributeId":"classes-and-workshops"}]}}]},"disabledClassifications":["participation-and-endurance","markets-and-community","business-event","food-and-wine","music-and-festivals"]}